     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hello, I am having a problem with subsetting the database based on selectInput. </div><div>I get the error </div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.818181991577148px;outline:none;border-style:none;line-height:15.454545021057129px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(225,226,229);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in `$&lt;-.data.frame`(`*tmp*`, &quot;SCALE_X&quot;, value = 1L) : \r\n  replacement has 1 rows, data has 0</span></pre></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>I looked at thread <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/shiny-discuss/selectinput/shiny-discuss/A4RAGyuzQTw/cfbky3qX7NMJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!searchin/shiny-discuss/selectinput/shiny-discuss/A4RAGyuzQTw/cfbky3qX7NMJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406873942000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3TXfanHdUZ_CgvPdX2Ds42\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/shiny-discuss/selectinput/shiny-discuss/A4RAGyuzQTw/cfbky3qX7NMJ</a>, which looked ver similar to this but it did not help me. </div><div><br></div><div>however, if I use manual selection for subset criteria, (commented out below), It works. </div><div>What am I missing?<br></div><div>Any suggestion?</div><div><br></div><div>I am running this from github, <span style=\"font-family:Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.818181991577148px;line-height:15.454545021057129px;white-space:pre;color:blue\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.818181991577148px;line-height:15.454545021057129px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:blue\">runGitHub(&quot;shinyGLMMLM&quot;, &quot;anantaacharya&quot;), </span><span style=\"font-family:Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.818181991577148px;line-height:15.454545021057129px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><font color=\"#000000\">data is there, if somebody wants to look at it.</font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.818181991577148px;line-height:15.454545021057129px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Monaco,monospace;font-size:11.818181991577148px;line-height:15.454545021057129px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><font color=\"#000000\">Thank you</font></span></div><b><div><b><br></b></div>server.r</b><div><br></div><div><div>library(shiny)</div><div>library(ggplot2)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>masterglmmlm.test &lt;- read.csv(&quot;masterglmmlm.q.csv&quot;, stringsAsFactors=F)</div><div><br></div><div> </div><div>shinyServer(function(input, output) {</div><div> output$textout&lt;-renderText({input$GLMMLM})</div><div><br></div><div> </div><div>  output$main_plot &lt;- renderPlot({</div><div>    #get subset of data based on selection</div><div>    plot.temp &lt;- reactive({</div><div>    gl1&lt;-input$GLMMLM</div><div>   df1&lt;-input$df</div><div>   model1&lt;-input$model1</div><div>   #gl1&lt;-c(&quot;MLM&quot;,&quot;K-EMMA&quot;)</div><div>#df1&lt;-c(&quot;10k20&quot;,&quot;UNEAK9&quot;)</div><div>#model1&lt;-c(&quot;PC&quot;,&quot;Q&quot;)</div><div> </div><div>    masterglmmlm.test[masterglmmlm.test$GLMMLM %in% gl1 &amp; masterglmmlm.test$model %in% model1 &amp; masterglmmlm.test$df %in% df1,,drop=FALSE]</div><div>    </div><div>  })</div><div><br></div><div>    p&lt;-ggplot(aes(pos, -log10(p), colour=interaction(GLMMLM, model)), data=plot.temp())+geom_point(aes(shape=df))+facet_wrap(~Locus)</div><div>   </div><div>    print(p)</div><div>  })</div><div><br></div><div>})</div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>ui.r</b></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:18px\"><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">library<span>(</span>shiny<span>)</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"> </div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">shinyUI<span>(</span>pageWithSidebar<span>(</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"> </div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">  headerPanel<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;GLM MLM p values&quot;</span><span>),</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"> </div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">  sidebarPanel<span>(</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"> <br></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">      selectInput<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;GLMMLM&quot;</span><span>,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;GLMMLM:&quot;</span><span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                   list<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;GLM&quot;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;GLM&quot;</span> <span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                     <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;MLM&quot;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;MLM&quot;</span> <span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                     <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;K-EMMA&quot;</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;K-EMMA&quot;</span><span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                      <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;K-SSR&quot;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;K-SSR&quot;</span><span>),</span> selected<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;K-EMMA&quot;</span><span>,</span> multiple<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">TRUE</span><span>)</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><br></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">    <span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><br></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">      selectInput<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;model&quot;</span><span>,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;model:&quot;</span><span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                   list<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;NAIVE&quot;</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;NAIVE&quot;</span><span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                     <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;PC&quot;</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;PC&quot;</span><span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                     <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;Q&quot;</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;Q&quot;</span><span>),</span> selected<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;Q&quot;</span><span>,</span> multiple<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">TRUE</span><span>)</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"> </div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">      </div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">    <span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><br></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">    selectInput<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;df&quot;</span><span>,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;data:&quot;</span><span>,</span><br></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                   list<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;10k20&quot;</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;10k20&quot;</span><span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                     <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;10k50&quot;</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;10k50&quot;</span><span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                     <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;UNEAK3&quot;</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;UNEAK3&quot;</span><span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                      <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;UNEAK4&quot;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;UNEAK4&quot;</span><span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                      <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;UNEAK8&quot;</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;UNEAK8&quot;</span><span>,</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">                      <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;UNEAK9&quot;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;UNEAK9&quot;</span><span>),</span>selected<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;10k20&quot;</span><span>,</span> multiple<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">TRUE</span><span>)</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><br></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">  <span>),</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"> </div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">  mainPanel<span>(</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span>#testing if selected was indeed selected</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">   htmlOutput<span>(</span>outputId<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;textout&quot;</span><span>),</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">    plotOutput<span>(</span>outputId <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;main_plot&quot;</span><span>)</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><br></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\">  <span>)</span></div><div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span>))</span></div></pre></div></div>"
